BS5 Containers: https://www.w3schools.com/bootstrap5/bootstrap_containers.php

fixed containers:
<div class="container">
</div>
The container class provides a responsive, fixed-width container.

fluid containers:
<div class="container-fluid>
</div>
The container-fluid class provides a full-width container, occupying the entire length of the viewport.

container padding:
<div class="container p-5">
</div>
5 pt, all-around padding

