BS5 Grid Basic: https://www.w3schools.com/bootstrap5/bootstrap_grid_basic.php

grids:
<div class="row">
  <div class="col">
    Row 1, Column 1 (automatically formatted)
  </div>
  <div class="col">
    Row 1, Column 2 (automatically formatted)
  </div>
</div>
<div class="row">
  <div class="col-sm-6"> 
    Row 2, Column 1 (responsive to small devices, greater than or equal to 576 px)
  </div>
  <div class="col-sm-6">
    Row 2, Column 2 (responsive to small devices, greater than or equal to 576 px)
  </div>
</div>

12 grid columns total, total columns must add up to 12

